[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,28,56,65,51,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"11700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,28,56,65,51,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"11700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,28,56,65,51,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"11700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,28,56,65,51,63],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"99","reputation":"11700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,28,56,65,51,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"10750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,28,56,65,51,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"10750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国官臣，曹爽参军。侍中辛毗之子，才女辛宪英之弟，出身陇西辛氏名门。高平陵之变中，辛敞因恐惧向姐姐辛宪英求救，最终选择“尽忠职守”而非投机站队，既保全家族又未彻底得罪司马氏。事后被司马懿评价为“义举”，官复原职并获司马氏信任。","tc":"魏國官臣，曹爽參軍。侍中辛毗之子，才女辛憲英之弟，出身隴西辛氏名門。高平陵之變中，辛敞因恐懼向姐姐辛憲英求救，最終選擇“盡忠職守”而非投機站隊，既保全家族又未徹底得罪司馬氏。事后被司馬懿評價為“義舉”，官復原職并獲司馬氏信任。","en":"An official of Wei and staff officer to Cao Shuang. Son of Commandant Xin Pi and younger brother of the talented woman Xin Xianying, born into the prestigious Xin clan of Longxi. During the Incident at Gaoping Tombs, a terrified Xin Chang sought help from his sister Xin Xianying and ultimately chose to ‘fulfill his duty’ rather than opportunistically pick sides, which preserved his family while avoiding a complete falling-out with the Sima clan. Sima Yi later praised his conduct as a ‘righteous act’, restored him to his position, and the Sima clan placed their trust in him.","jp":"魏の臣で、曹爽の参軍を務めた。侍中・辛毗の子であり、才女・辛憲英の弟。隴西辛氏の名門の出身。高平陵の変の際、辛敞は恐れのあまり姉の辛憲英に助けを求めたが、最終的には日和見な立ち回りを排して「職責を全うする」道を選び、家族を守りつつも司馬氏を決定的に敵に回す事態を避けた。事後には司馬懿から「義挙」と称賛され、元の官職に復帰した上で司馬氏の信任を得た。","kr":"위나라의 관리이자 조상의 참군이다. 시중 신비의 아들이자 재녀 신헌영의 남동생으로, 농서 신씨 명문 가문 출신이다. 고평릉의 변 당시 신창은 두려운 마음에 누나 신헌영에게 도움을 청했고, 기회주의적인 줄서기 대신 '직무에 충실할 것'을 택하여 가문을 보전하는 한편 사마씨에게도 완전히 밉보이지 않았다. 사태가 수습된 뒤 사마의에게 '의로운 행동'이라는 평가를 받아 본래 관직으로 복직하였으며, 사마씨의 신임을 얻었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10461","remark":"","surname":"辛","surnameTc":"辛","surnameEn":"Xin","surnameJp":"辛","surnameKr":"신","surnameOther":"","name":"敞","nameTc":"敞","nameEn":"Chang","nameJp":"敞","nameKr":"창","nameOther":"","word":"泰雍","wordTc":"泰雍","wordEn":"Taiyong","wordJp":"泰雍","wordKr":"태옹","wordOther":"","icon":"辛敞","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","rec